{"id":"turpan","name":"吐鲁番","en":"Turpan","country":"China","lat":42.95,"lng":89.1822,"dek":"火焰山下的绿洲，干与甜的城市","history":"吐鲁番盆地是天山东段的山间盆地，中心部分低于海平面，艾丁湖湖面是中国陆地最低点。汉代这里称姑师，后称车师，是西域三十六国之一。公元前一世纪，西汉与匈奴在此反复争夺，车师前后庭几度易手。公元前60年，匈奴日逐王降汉，西域都护府建立，吐鲁番正式纳入汉朝西域经营体系。","culture":"吐鲁番的文化底色是绿洲灌溉农业。坎儿井把天山雪水从地下引到农田，减少蒸发，这种地下渠道系统与长城、大运河并称中国古代三大工程。\n\n葡萄是吐鲁番最具代表性的物产，无核白葡萄晾制成葡萄干，荫房是当地特有的建筑。十二木卡姆和麦西热甫是维吾尔族重要的音乐与聚会传统，在吐鲁番的乡村婚礼和节庆中仍能见到。","pull":"坎儿井把雪水藏在地下，葡萄把阳光晒成糖。","sights":[{"name":"交河故城","orig":"交河故城","intro":"位于吐鲁番市区西侧雅尔乃孜沟中的台地上，是车师前国都城遗址，唐代安西都护府一度设于此。整座城市从生土中掏挖而成，街巷、院落、佛寺的轮廓至今清晰，黄昏时土墙呈赭红色。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Jiaohe_City%28Yarkhoto%29%2CTurpan%2CXinjiang_HY2.jpg/960px-Jiaohe_City%28Yarkhoto%29%2CTurpan%2CXinjiang_HY2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%B2%B3%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E"},{"name":"高昌故城","orig":"高昌故城","intro":"在吐鲁番东约四十公里的戈壁中，是曲氏高昌国都城和唐代西州的治所。外城、内城、宫城三重城垣尚存，城内可辨认出佛寺、作坊和民居基址，玄奘西行时曾在此讲经。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c4/%E9%AB%98%E6%98%8C%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E6%98%8C%E6%95%85%E5%9F%8E"},{"name":"柏孜克里克千佛洞","orig":"柏孜克里克千佛洞","intro":"位于火焰山木头沟西岸的崖壁上，开凿于曲氏高昌时期，唐代称宁戎寺。洞窟中的壁画以回鹘供养人像著称，二十世纪初被德国探险队大量切割运走，现存于柏林。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b4/%E6%9F%8F%E5%AD%9C%E5%85%8B%E9%87%8C%E5%85%8B%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E6%B4%9E_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%88%E8%87%AA%E5%8C%97%E5%90%91%E5%8D%97%EF%BC%89Bezeklik_Caves%2C_from_north_to_south._In_2023.jpg/960px-%E6%9F%8F%E5%AD%9C%E5%85%8B%E9%87%8C%E5%85%8B%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E6%B4%9E_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%88%E8%87%AA%E5%8C%97%E5%90%91%E5%8D%97%EF%BC%89Bezeklik_Caves%2C_from_north_to_south._In_2023.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9F%8F%E5%AD%9C%E5%85%8B%E9%87%8C%E5%85%8B%E5%8D%83%E4%BD%9B%E6%B4%9E"},{"name":"阿斯塔那古墓群","orig":"阿斯塔那古墓群","intro":"在吐鲁番东南约四十公里的戈壁中，是晋唐时期高昌居民的公共墓地。干燥气候保存了大量文书、绢画和面食点心，出土的伏羲女娲绢画和饺子实物是研究西域生活的直接材料。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/%E9%98%BF%E6%96%AF%E5%A1%94%E9%82%A3%E5%8F%A4%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4_%E5%A4%A7%E9%97%A8.jpg/960px-%E9%98%BF%E6%96%AF%E5%A1%94%E9%82%A3%E5%8F%A4%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4_%E5%A4%A7%E9%97%A8.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E6%96%AF%E5%A1%94%E9%82%A3%E5%8F%A4%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4"},{"name":"苏公塔","orig":"苏公塔","intro":"位于吐鲁番市区东郊，乾隆年间吐鲁番郡王额敏和卓及其子苏来满为报清廷恩典而建，又称额敏塔。塔身用土黄色砖砌成，表面以砖块拼出十余种几何纹样，是新疆最大的古塔。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/%E8%8B%8F%E5%85%AC%E5%A1%94%E5%85%A8%E6%99%AF_2023.jpg/960px-%E8%8B%8F%E5%85%AC%E5%A1%94%E5%85%A8%E6%99%AF_2023.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%8F%E5%85%AC%E5%A1%94"}],"foods":[{"name":"吐鲁番葡萄","orig":"葡萄","intro":"吐鲁番是全国最著名的葡萄产区之一，无核白葡萄皮薄肉脆，含糖量高。夏季在葡萄沟的葡萄架下现摘现吃，晾房里的葡萄干则要经过四十天左右的阴干。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e3/Close_up_grapes.jpg/960px-Close_up_grapes.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":640},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%91%A1%E8%90%84"},{"name":"烤包子","orig":"烤包子","intro":"维吾尔语称萨姆萨，用死面擀成方皮，包入羊肉丁、洋葱和孜然，贴在馕坑壁上烤熟。外壳焦脆，咬开后肉汁和洋葱的甜味一起涌出，趁热吃最好。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/%D0%9E%D1%88_%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BC%D1%81%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%8B.jpg/960px-%D0%9E%D1%88_%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BC%D1%81%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%8B.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":688},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%83%A4%E5%8C%85%E5%AD%90"},{"name":"手抓饭","orig":"手抓饭","intro":"维吾尔语称波劳，用大米、羊肉、胡萝卜和洋葱焖制，油亮喷香。吐鲁番一带常加入葡萄干和杏干，甜咸交织，是巴扎上和婚礼宴席上的主食。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c4/Tajik_plov.jpg/960px-Tajik_plov.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1320},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%8A%93%E9%A5%AD"},{"name":"馕","orig":"馕","intro":"在馕坑中烤成的圆形面饼，是吐鲁番人日常的主食。刚出坑的馕边缘厚软、中间薄脆，撒有芝麻或洋葱碎，可掰开蘸茶或夹烤肉吃。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/57/Stuffed_Tandoori_Naan.jpg/960px-Stuffed_Tandoori_Naan.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":960},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A6%95"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/Turpan_-_%D8%AA%DB%87%D8%B1%D9%BE%D8%A7%D9%86.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":896},{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a3/Grapes_and_oil%2C_Liuyuan-Turfan_2012.jpg/1280px-Grapes_and_oil%2C_Liuyuan-Turfan_2012.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[87.2598653,43.1359008],[87.2650685,43.1314377],[87.2695679,43.1213806],[87.2687536,43.1149298],[87.2692249,43.1120481],[87.2726084,43.1051528],[87.2704683,43.1031502],[87.2725239,43.0977917],[87.2717954,43.0943772],[87.273293,43.0893621],[87.2732932,43.0845373],[87.284042,43.0830514],[87.2898224,43.0810999],[87.291618,43.0789068],[87.292045,43.0759289],[87.2975665,43.0751054],[87.2984223,43.0729716],[87.3049271,43.0714878],[87.3116443,43.0721644],[87.3226841,43.0671608],[87.3318392,43.0666104],[87.3334654,43.0646009],[87.3361604,43.0635611],[87.337358,43.0605186],[87.3453173,43.0553926],[87.3517787,43.053782],[87.354005,43.0519289],[87.3569157,43.0516114],[87.3574295,43.050387],[87.3591833,43.0500085],[87.3619681,43.0459286],[87.36723